      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": false
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Annotator Dev.app asks for Screen Recording, Microphone, and Accessibility once. The pinned signing identity keeps these grants across rebuilds, as it does for the live app."
